    description: "Add promote-then-demote phase to refine_frameworks. Promote a framework when prod-non-test import edges match its _import_modules_for_framework patterns, even when manifest is silent. Specificity gate: scoped (@apollo/server) or compound (foo/bar) patterns auto-promote; bare names (react, vue, graphql) require manifest evidence. Closes the structural-fix half of INV-rojip; the four prior targeted patches (WI-lohok, WI-himas, WI-rofiz, WI-donud) remain in place and a follow-on WI-deprecate-targeted-patches will audit which can be reverted."  # ff97
    fields:  # ff97
      statement: "Framework detection promotes a framework to profile.frameworks when prod-non-test source files import a module matching its registered import-module patterns, gated on a specificity rule (scoped or compound auto-promote; bare names require manifest evidence)."  # ff97
