  message: "Merged via PR #3915 as commit 659c575645. Two-phase model in refine_frameworks: promote (manifest-silent → frameworks) runs before demote (test-only → dev_frameworks). Specificity gate (_is_specific_pattern) accepts scoped/slash-compound/dot-compound patterns; bare names continue to require manifest evidence per the WI-rofiz lesson. _module_matches extended for slash-prefix subpaths. _has_prod_import_match helper consolidates the inner loop. 11 new tests pin the invariants; 100% coverage on profile.py maintained. CI green first try; INV-rahib streak holds at 8-of-8 in current cohort. INV-rojip stays violated pending the bare-name extension (cohorts 2+3 of its closure cohort: bakerydemo Django, chatwoot Rails)."  # 0f0c
